raph","text":"気になります(*ﾟﾛﾟ)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/09/5345849/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"APOGEEというバンドの"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"オリジナルでつくって"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いただいた曲です"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/09/5345849/0016.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゆるくてかっこいい><"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"好きなおかずは、先に食べる人？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"後に食べる人？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/09/5345849/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そん時の気分かなぁ笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ピーマン様は最後の"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しみにするかな"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/09/5345849/0017.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今度の個握、かなりの枚数の"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"握手券があるんやけど、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"１枚づつ来るのってうざい？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/09/5345849/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんなそんな‼"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりかはいつでもwelcomeよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/09/5345849/0018.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たくさんしゃべろー♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりかっ